    "volume_db": -22
   },
   "enfase": [
    {
     "em": "Good",
     "pose": "c_cafe_convite",
     "segurar": 2.2
    }
   ],
   "pausa_antes_s": 5.5
  },
  {
   "fala": "Tell me something. And be honest."
  },
  {
   "fala": "Have you ever felt… someone walking behind you? Inside your own home?"
  },
  {
   "fala": "That chill in the hallway. That certainty that if you turn around right now, someone will be there.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H3.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.1,
     1.22
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.55,
      0.45
     ],
     [
      0.6,
      0.35
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "dir"
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "So you turn around. And there's no one.",
   "cena": {
    "tipo": "texto",
    "texto": "And there's no one.",
    "vermelho": "one.",
    "estilo": "impacto",
    "cps": 12
   },
   "sem_legenda": false
  },
  {
   "fala": "Everyone has felt it. And tonight, I'm going to tell you about a man who decided to find out why.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "../../painel/cenarios/abrigo_16x9.png",
    "vigia": true,
    "zoom": [
     1.04,
     1.0
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.6,
      0.45
     ],
     [
      0.55,
      0.5
     ]
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "In twenty fourteen, in Switzerland, a group of scientists ran a strange experiment.",
   "cena": {
    "tipo": "cartao",
    "imagem": "imagens/R1.png",
    "legenda_cartao": "EPFL · Switzerland · 2014",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "giro": -1.5
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "Volunteers were blindfolded and moved a robotic arm in front of their bodies. And a second robot, behind them, touched their backs. With a half-second delay.",
   "cena": {
    "tipo": "cartao",
    "imagem": "imagens/R1.png",
    "legenda_cartao": "EPFL · Switzerland · 2014",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "giro": 1.2
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "Many of them began to feel someone standing behind them. Some counted two, three, four presences. Some begged them to stop."
  },
  {
   "fala": "The scientists' conclusion was simple: it's the brain. A delay between what the body does and what it feels. Nothing more.",
   "cena": {
    "tipo": "cartao",
    "imagem": "imagens/R1.png",
    "legenda_cartao": "EPFL · Switzerland · 2014",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "giro": -1.5
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "Nothing more.",
   "cena": {
    "tipo": "texto",
    "texto": "Nothing more.",
    "estilo": "impacto",
    "cps": 12
   },
   "sem_legenda": true
  },
  {
   "fala": "Rafael was thirty-four. A sound engineer. He lived alone in an old apartment, on the third floor, at the end of a quiet street.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H1.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.5,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.536,
      0.515
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "esq"
   },
   "pausa_antes_s": 1.5
  },
  {
   "fala": "And ever since he was a child, he had felt it.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H1.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.18,
     1.26
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.62,
      0.55
     ],
     [
      0.62,
      0.52
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "esq"
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "The first time was at his grandmother's house, in the countryside. A long hallway, with creaking floorboards, that ran from the kitchen to the bedrooms.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/R5.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.5,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.485,
      0.5
     ]
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "He was about seven. Every night, he ran down that hallway, certain that someone was coming after him.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/R5.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.18,
     1.26
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.45,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.45,
      0.47
     ]
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "Once, he told his grandmother. She didn't laugh. She just held his face in both hands and said, very seriously:"
  },
  {
   "fala": "\"Don't look for it, child. If you don't look… you won't find.\"",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/R5.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.06,
     1.0
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.475,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.5,
      0.5
     ]
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "He never understood what she meant. Not until many years later."
  },
  {
   "fala": "At first, it was rare. Every now and then, watching TV, he'd feel someone's eyes on the back of his neck.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H2.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.5,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.47000000000000003,
      0.476
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "dir"
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "But it was in the hallway that it truly began.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H3.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.5,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.476,
      0.47000000000000003
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "dir"
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "The apartment had a long hallway, from the living room to the bedroom. And every time he walked down it at night, he felt someone coming up behind him.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H3.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.18,
     1.26
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.42,
      0.4
     ],
     [
      0.42,
      0.37
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "dir"
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "He would stop. The silence stopped with him.",
   "sons": [
    {
     "em": "him.",
     "som": "passos_atrasados",
     "volume_db": -4,
     "depois": true,
     "atraso": 0.0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "fala": "And every time he turned around… the hallway was empty.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H3.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.06,
     1.0
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.45999999999999996,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.5,
      0.5
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "dir"
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "Try something right now. Don't look behind you.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "../../painel/cenarios/abrigo_16x9.png",
    "vigia": true,
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.04
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.55,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.57,
      0.48
     ]
    ]
   },
   "enfase": [
    {
     "em": "Try",
     "pose": "s_silencio",
     "segurar": 2.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "fala": "Just pay attention to the back of your neck.",
   "cena": {
    "tipo": "texto",
    "texto": "Don't look behind you.",
    "vermelho": "you.",
    "estilo": "impacto",
    "cps": 12
   },
   "sem_legenda": false
  },
  {
   "fala": "Feel that?",
   "enfase": [
    {
     "em": "Feel",
     "pose": "s_encarando",
     "segurar": 2.0
    }
   ],
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "../../painel/cenarios/abrigo_16x9.png",
    "vigia": true,
    "zoom": [
     1.08,
     1.12
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.3,
      0.6
     ],
     [
      0.3,
      0.6
     ]
    ]
   },
   "pausa_antes_s": 1.6
  },
  {
   "fala": "Over time, the feeling stopped being rare.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H4.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.5,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.416,
      0.476
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "dir"
   },
   "musica": {
    "som": "trilha_tensa_2",
    "volume_db": -22
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "Every night. In the kitchen, opening the fridge. In the shower. Lying in bed.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H4.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.18,
     1.26
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.22,
      0.42
     ],
     [
      0.22,
      0.39
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "dir"
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "And the worst part wasn't feeling someone behind him. The worst part was feeling that, every night, it was a little closer."
  },
  {
   "fala": "closer.",
   "cena": {
    "tipo": "texto",
    "texto": "closer.",
    "estilo": "impacto",
    "cps": 12
   },
   "sem_legenda": true
  },
  {
   "fala": "He started hearing things. Footsteps in the hallway that stopped half a second after his own. Slow breathing, right after he turned off the light.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H5.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.5,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.566,
      0.515
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "esq"
   },
   "pausa_antes_s": 1.3
  },
  {
   "fala": "Being a sound engineer, he did what he knew how to do. He left a professional microphone recording in the hallway all night long.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/R6.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.5,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.485,
      0.53
     ]
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "In the morning, he put on his headphones and listened. Hours of silence. His own footsteps going to the bathroom, at two in the morning.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/R6.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.18,
     1.26
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.45,
      0.6
     ],
     [
      0.45,
      0.57
     ]
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "And right after each of his steps… another step. Lighter. Half a second behind.",
   "sons": [
    {
     "em": "step.",
     "som": "passos_atrasados",
     "volume_db": -4,
     "depois": true,
     "atraso": 0.0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "fala": "He played that part about twenty times. Whenever he stopped in the hallway, the other footsteps stopped too.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/R6.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.06,
     1.0
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.475,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.5,
      0.5
     ]
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "Except, the last time, after he had already gone back to bed… the footsteps kept going. Slowly. All the way to the bedroom door.",
   "sons": [
    {
     "em": "door.",
     "som": "stinger_cordas",
     "volume_db": -8,
     "depois": true,
     "atraso": 0.0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "fala": "He went to a doctor. Had tests done. Everything was normal.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H5.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.5,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.566,
      0.515
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "esq"
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "The doctor prescribed sleeping pills and said it was stress. Exhaustion.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H5.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.18,
     1.26
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.72,
      0.55
     ],
     [
      0.72,
      0.52
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "esq"
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "The pills made him sleep. But they didn't make the feeling go away."
  },
  {
   "fala": "It was on one of those sleepless nights that he found the study from Switzerland.",
   "cena": {
    "tipo": "cartao",
    "imagem": "imagens/R1.png",
    "legenda_cartao": "EPFL · Switzerland · 2014",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "giro": -1.5
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "And, for the first time in months, he felt relief. It was the brain. That's all. A half-second delay.",
   "cena": {
    "tipo": "cartao",
    "imagem": "imagens/R1.png",
    "legenda_cartao": "EPFL · Switzerland · 2014",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "giro": 1.2
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "For a few days, it worked. He slept better. He walked down the hallway without looking back."
  },
  {
   "fala": "Until the night when, brushing his teeth, he felt the back of his neck go cold.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H6.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.5,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.458,
      0.485
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "dir"
   },
   "musica": {
    "som": "silencio",
    "volume_db": -22
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "It wasn't a shiver. It was cold. As if someone were breathing right there, inches away from him.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H6.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.18,
     1.26
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.36,
      0.45
     ],
     [
      0.36,
      0.42000000000000004
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "dir"
   },
   "sons": [
    {
     "em": "breathing",
     "som": "respiracao_nuca",
     "volume_db": -2,
     "depois": true,
     "atraso": 0.0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "fala": "He didn't turn around. For the first time, he was afraid to turn around."
  },
  {
   "fala": "After that night, Rafael changed the whole apartment.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H7.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.5,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.572,
      0.506
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "esq"
   },
   "musica": {
    "som": "trilha_tensa_2",
    "volume_db": -22
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "He pushed all the furniture against the walls. Left the lights on. Put mirrors in the corners, to see what was coming up behind him.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H7.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.18,
     1.26
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.74,
      0.52
     ],
     [
      0.74,
      0.49
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "esq"
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "And he started sleeping sitting up, with his back to the wall."
  },
  {
   "fala": "But the feeling didn't go away. It just kept getting closer.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/H7.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.06,
     1.0
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.62,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.5,
      0.5
     ]
    ],
    "lado": "esq"
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "One Sunday, his brother Lucas showed up unannounced. He thought the apartment looked strange. The furniture pressed against the walls, the mirrors, the lights on in broad daylight.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/R7.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.0,
     1.06
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.5,
      0.5
     ],
     [
      0.5,
      0.485
     ]
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "Rafael tried to explain. Lucas laughed, a little awkwardly. Said he needed some sleep, needed to get out, see people.",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/R7.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.18,
     1.26
    ],
    "foco": [
     [
      0.5,
      0.45
     ],
     [
      0.5,
      0.42000000000000004
     ]
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "fala": "On his way out, halfway down the hallway, Lucas stopped. He rubbed the back of his neck."
  },
  {
   "fala": "\"Man… where is this draft coming from?\"",
   "cena": {
    "imagem": "imagens/R7.png",
    "zoom": [
     1.06,
     1.0
